{"term": {"label": "性", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "性", "variants": [], "id": "性"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "間", "id": "間"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.677972745864932, "source": "君子", "target": "間"}, {"weight": 2.677972745864932, "source": "君子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 2.677972745864932, "source": "君子", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 1.0685348334308318, "source": "君子", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 1.9848255653049869, "source": "君子", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.0685348334308318, "source": "君子", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.28007747306656167, "source": "君子", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.8862132766368772, "source": "君子", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.9848255653049869, "source": "君子", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.0685348334308318, "source": "君子", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.5793604571968225, "source": "君子", "target": "經"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "行", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 0.8678641379686807, "source": "行", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.4739999415389962, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.7841548698428356, "source": "道", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.7841548698428356, "source": "道", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.8678641379686807, "source": "道", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "聞", "target": "大"}]}}